{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/089afbe38d7c42de0116f57823f541d8.apng?t=1762793647\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/089afbe38d7c42de0116f57823f541d8.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span><strong><i>\u00a0 Drill Bird</i></strong><strong> is a cozy-yet-tense digging platformer where every trip underground counts. You play as a Bird, fallen from the sky, working to hatch your egg. With a drill for a beak you dig deep for precious ores, and bring them back to to empower your Egg and upgrade your abilities. Outsmart monsters, upgrade your drill, and don\u2019t let night catch you too far from home.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG DEEP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore underground caves, mine valuable ores, and uncover hidden treasure. Every block you break or not will bring you closer to helping your egg hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/e853255c1432adb052a09ed6cdbda25d.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" width=644 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/e853255c1432adb052a09ed6cdbda25d.webm?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/e853255c1432adb052a09ed6cdbda25d.mp4?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED AND GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ores and feed your egg to grow stronger. The deeper you dig, the bigger opportunities - but every choice matters and will bring risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/d7a1a6eb987b396310e01a17da8dc701.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" width=644 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/d7a1a6eb987b396310e01a17da8dc701.webm?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/d7a1a6eb987b396310e01a17da8dc701.mp4?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/b4573d37873da585d679188195a7c17f.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" width=634 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/b4573d37873da585d679188195a7c17f.webm?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/b4573d37873da585d679188195a7c17f.mp4?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTSMART MONSTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous creatures lurk in the dark. Drill, dodge, and outmaneuver them to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/d51de2930d1ae2e17f376824f8bbbc42.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" width=644 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/d51de2930d1ae2e17f376824f8bbbc42.webm?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/d51de2930d1ae2e17f376824f8bbbc42.mp4?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET HOME BEFORE NIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is always ticking. Make it back before darkness falls\u2026 or face what comes for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/21108d32312d5eb39f12071371cd15bc.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" width=644 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/21108d32312d5eb39f12071371cd15bc.webm?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/21108d32312d5eb39f12071371cd15bc.mp4?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>FEATURES\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 A cozy-yet-tense platformer with tight design and satisfying digging <br>\u2705 Upgrade your drill, carry strength, health, and more <br>\u2705 Outsmart monsters and solve problems in underground encounters <br>\u2705 Feed and protect your egg - your future depends on it<br>\u2705 Simple, atmospheric story told without words<br>\u2705 A short, satisfying game loop of survival and care</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All in a week's work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809940/0dce3998dc7f1751cb9be16f4bf7ee4b52e61553.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunning parenthood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3809940/5cdac723fb6397369e43b9e681708010c56bab1b.jpg"},{"name":"Ore lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/